Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 19:35:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] mtp dump: env-gated extraction of target hc_hidden +
 per-token argmax

New module sglang/srt/models/mtp_dump.py plus two call sites in qwen4_exp.py
(16 added lines).  Active only when SGLANG_MTP_DUMP_DIR is set; on every target
extend forward it saves input_ids / positions / hc_hidden [T,10240] (the
pre-hyper_connection_mixer residual the draft head consumes) / target_argmax
recomputed chunk-wise through the target lm_head, one safetensors file per
forward, written from a background thread with a bounded queue.

Decode, target-verify and CUDA-graph capture paths bail out immediately, so the
graph replay path is untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
